<ContentLayout
  title="Mifflin-St Jeor Equation — BMR Formula Explained (2026)"
  h1="Mifflin-St Jeor Equation"
  description="Mifflin-St Jeor equation for BMR. Learn the formula, accuracy, and how it powers our online calorie calculator. Better than Harris-Benedict."
  path="/guides/mifflin-st-jeor-equation/"
  category="Guides"
  categoryPath="/guides/"
  lead="The Mifflin-St Jeor equation is widely regarded as a reliable method for calculating basal metabolic rate and daily calorie needs."
  updated="June 2026"
